                %em The Conformal-Symmetry – Color-Neutrality Connection in Strong Interaction
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2208.06484"}> arXiv:2208.06484
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                Canberk Güvendik, Thomas Schaefer, Mithat Ünsal,
